OL,3,GNEWSAHubs plan unveiled to support 40
OL,4,Anew ambulances
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service (EMAS)
OL,7,Fhas announced plans to open larger hubs
OL,8,Fin a bid to meet growing demand.
OL,10,FEMAS - which serves Leicestershire,
OL,11,FNottinghamshire, Derbyshire,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, Northamptonshire and
OL,13,FRutland - said many of its buildings
OL,14,Fwere "ageing" and "difficult to
OL,15,Fmaintain".
OL,17,FIt added that in the next 10 years the
OL,18,Fservice would develop a small number of
OL,19,F"larger, modern ambulance 'hubs'",
OL,20,Fwhile continuing to invest in existing
OL,21,Fstations.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
